fix: inject missing CSS and JS dependencies into ported sections

Sections from the source theme relied on its base.css (315KB) for
layout styles, causing videos/images to render at full size without
constraints. Fixed by extracting the relevant CSS rules and inlining
them into each section, plus adding external CSS asset links and
JS script references where needed.

- Created splide-base.css (13KB) for slider sections
- Inlined layout CSS into 16 sections
- Added shrine-components.js to 8 sections needing custom elements
- Added external CSS links for content-tabs, pricing-table,
  bundle-deals, collage, and related-products
